{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02393",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.99,
      "end_seconds": 5.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.96,
      "end_seconds": 11.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.86,
      "end_seconds": 19.2,
      "duration_seconds": 6.34,
      "text": "Um, so... a bump on the head. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.12,
      "end_seconds": 24.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.28,
      "end_seconds": 28.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "About... well, ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.23,
      "end_seconds": 32.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Right, what eases it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.87,
      "end_seconds": 37.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I get some relief from a cold pack."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.84,
      "end_seconds": 41.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.92,
      "end_seconds": 53.65,
      "duration_seconds": 10.73,
      "text": "It usually comes with crying straight away. The, The crying straight away? That's been for about two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.12,
      "end_seconds": 61.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Have you had a bump on the head before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.95,
      "end_seconds": 68.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "A bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.93,
      "end_seconds": 72.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "A few quick ones: fit, drowsiness or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.63,
      "end_seconds": 78.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Mm, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.05,
      "end_seconds": 81.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "How about loss of consciousness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.42,
      "end_seconds": 86.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "No, no loss of consciousness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.5,
      "end_seconds": 89.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.44,
      "end_seconds": 93.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.69,
      "end_seconds": 98.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.28,
      "end_seconds": 102.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Erm, no, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.07,
      "end_seconds": 108.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Right, what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.28,
      "end_seconds": 117.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "Well, I take bisoprolol, once a day for the heart rhythm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.81,
      "end_seconds": 119.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.71,
      "end_seconds": 122.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "2.5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.07,
      "end_seconds": 126.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.09,
      "end_seconds": 130.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "About nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.32,
      "end_seconds": 151.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.55,
      "end_seconds": 155.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "I have an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.68,
      "end_seconds": 157.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.65,
      "end_seconds": 163.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Arthritis in my knees, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.44,
      "end_seconds": 172.02,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "Alright, an irregular heartbeat, that matches what I have here. A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.25,
      "end_seconds": 184.05,
      "duration_seconds": 10.8,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays. My partner and our baby. I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.7,
      "end_seconds": 190.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.41,
      "end_seconds": 195.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.49,
      "end_seconds": 216.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.24,
      "end_seconds": 225.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.06,
      "end_seconds": 251.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 36.8 degrees, pressure 110 over 78, pulse is 78 beats a minute, saturation 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.15,
      "end_seconds": 256.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Alright, may I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.87,
      "end_seconds": 259.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.89,
      "end_seconds": 276.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "There is a small lump on the forehead, he is alert, and his pupils and movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.57,
      "end_seconds": 281.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.68,
      "end_seconds": 304.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "Taking everything into account, my working impression is a minor head bump with no worrying signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.4,
      "end_seconds": 307.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.76,
      "end_seconds": 334.5,
      "duration_seconds": 25.74,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a minor head bump with no worrying signs. Watch him for the next twenty-four hours and give paracetamol if he is sore. If he vomits repeatedly, becomes drowsy or has a fit, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. I'd like to see you again if any vomiting or drowsiness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.15,
      "end_seconds": 338.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Okay, I'll arrange it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.38,
      "end_seconds": 343.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.07,
      "end_seconds": 348.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "No, uh, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.66,
      "end_seconds": 351.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}